OL,3,AIsrael warns of 'forceful' response to
OL,4,Akites flown from Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael has warned Hamas that it will
OL,7,Fincrease strikes on Gaza following
OL,8,Fconcern over launches of kites, drones
OL,9,Fand balloons from the territory.
OL,11,FSeveral kites were found in an Israeli
OL,12,Fcommunity near the border with Gaza
OL,13,Fover the weekend, local media reported.
OL,15,F"Forceful actions will be taken to put
OL,16,Fan end to this phenomenon," Israel's
OL,17,FDefence Minister Israel Katz said on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
