OL,3,AIsrael warns of 'forceful' response to
OL,4,Akites flown from Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore the war, kites and balloons
OL,7,Fcarrying incendiary devices were
OL,8,Flaunched into Israel, causing fires
OL,9,Fthat burned forest and farmland.
